			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 766530201,
					"content": "Where did I go wrong? If only I had more than theoretical knowledge...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ginette"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530202,
					"content": "Okay, no need to confirm this order... This is Ginette, a Fontainian engineer. Of all the orders I got, this one was the most interesting!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aino"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530203,
					"content": "You're finally here! So there's still hope...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ginette"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530204,
					"content": "Hi there! We're Aino's assistants... Or, well, Paimon thinks you can call us that. Whaddya need help with?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530205,
					"content": "She's made a type of robot that can use kuuvahki to achieve long-distance communication... which sounds super fun! But she's run into a whole bunch of malfunctions, and so she wants me to help her troubleshoot her stuff.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aino"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530206,
					"content": "I'm ashamed to admit that trial-and-error curiosity won't yield any results. In the end, it still boils down to practice...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ginette"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530207,
					"content": "Doesn't sound that hard... Just leave it to us!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530208,
					"content": "This is a bit embarrassing, but... I'd like to modify my order. While waiting for your reply, I... Well, I ended up making another mess of things...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ginette"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530209,
					"content": "I was suddenly curious if a change of environment could solve the issue. So I conducted more tests in areas with different kuuvahki concentrations.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ginette"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530210,
					"content": "...But the malfunctions still happened, and I ended up losing those robots. Sooo... apart from the agreed-upon debugging... Could you help me retrieve the robots as well...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ginette"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530211,
					"content": "You lost the robots? All of them?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530212,
					"content": "If you need me to compensate with extra pay, I'll think of something, I promise!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ginette"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530213,
					"content": "Hmm.... But there should be many ways to track them down. Since the robots are all powered by kuuvahki, they should leave behind kuuvahki remnants wherever they go.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aino"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530214,
					"content": "I'll prep a special device for you. Once you use it to collect enough kuuvahki remnants, you'll be able to track down whichever robot left 'em behind.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aino"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530215,
					"content": "Hmm-hmm... Well, this sounds fun! And since it does, I won't ask for extra pay!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766530216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aino"
				},
				{
					"id": 766530216,
					"content": "Really? Thank you, thank you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Ginette"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}